'''Molten Sand''' is an obstacle encountered in the [[Fortis Colosseum]]. It is spawned during the boss fight against [[Sol Heredit]] and deals 6-8 damage per tick when stood upon. A stronger version can also be spawned by [[Javelin Colossus|Javelin Colossi]] when any tier of the Reentry modifier is active, as well as by any NPC when the Volatility III modifier is active, dealing up to 15 damage every other tick.

